# Garmin ingest (gofastapp-mvp)

## Raw vs product

| Layer | Table / field | Role |
|-------|----------------|------|
| Raw Garmin | `athlete_activities` | Summary webhook row; sidecar completes `detailData` |
| Sidecar pointer | `workouts.garminDetailActivityId` | Join raw activity → spawned workout for detail + laps ingest |
| Product | `workouts.id` (`workoutId`) | Home, Train, lists, push, reflection — always this |
| Plan snap | `workouts.plannedWorkoutId` | Spawned row snapped onto `planned_workouts` — not the Garmin pointer |

## Do NOT conflate

- **`garminDetailActivityId`** — Garmin/sidecar only. Used by `applyActivityToWorkout`, `handleActivityDetail`, lap parse lookups. **Never drop the write.**
- **`plannedWorkoutId`** — training plan match only.

Product surfaces (Home, Train, All activities, finish push) must **never** select, filter, or gate completion on `garminDetailActivityId`. Use **stamps** (`actualDistanceMeters`, `actualDurationSeconds`, etc.) and `workoutId`.

## Ingest flow (target)

```text
ingest raw → always spawn workoutId → stamp actuals → tryMatchWorkoutToTrainingPlan (plannedWorkoutId)
```

Sidecar `garmin-activity-detail-ingest` completes the same `athlete_activities` row and spawns laps onto `workoutId` via `workout_segments` / `workout_segment_laps`.

## Push

Finish push = `workout.complete` + deeplink `/workouts/{workoutId}`. Do not use `activity.synced` or `/activities/{id}` for runs.
